{
  "_doc": "Each case runs `python <scripts-dir>/<script>.py <args>` with the fixture as the project. Output is normalised (dates, absolute paths) and compared to golden/<name>.out. mutating=true cases run against a throwaway copy of the fixture and also record a digest of the files they create. The sample world is generated by tools/build_sample.py.",
